5,1,1,talk,Rin,,I'm so excited for our trip! But can we make sure we know exactly how much everything costs first? I hate it when the price changes later. What do you guys think we should check?,"{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,"Budget is important, Rin, but let's not get bogged down in pennies. I'm more concerned about how we actually get there. We shouldn't waste half the trip just staring at train station walls.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Asuka,,I agree with Rin. We need a clear financial structure to avoid any misunderstandings later. I suggest we look into all-in rates versus separate meals to see which is more predictable.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Takumi,,"I don't care about the pennies, but I do care about the schedule. We need to know about bathing hours and bathroom provision, and the inn mealtimes and room arrangements. We can't just wing it.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Toshio,,"I agree that logistics and budget are key. However, I think we should also consider the atmosphere. I'd like to know how last year's days ran and the time alone in the shared-house year.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Rin,,"@Shunichi, it's not about pennies, it's about the big total! I want to know the whole price now. I think we should check the all-in rates and the pricing of offshore houses let whole.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Rin, your obsession with the total is noted. But a cheap house is useless if we spend two days traveling to it. I'll be looking into ferry sailings and train times, and getting around by train and bus.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Shunichi, efficiency is important, but unpredictability in spending is a risk. I want to ensure the cost is distributed fairly. I'll look into all-in rates against meals bought separately and what separately booked rooms cost last time.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Asuka, costs aren't the only thing that can go wrong. If the room setup is a mess, the whole trip is ruined. I'm sticking with bathing hours and bathroom provision, plus inn mealtimes and room arrangements.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"It seems we have a good spread of priorities. To understand the balance between our group time and personal space, I will look into the time alone in the shared-house year and how last year's days ran.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Rin,,"@Toshio, that sounds a bit boring! I want to know if we can just pay one big price and be done with it. I'm definitely sticking with the all-in rates and the offshore house pricing!","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,"@Rin, your enthusiasm for a single invoice is almost touching. However, I'll stick to my plan. Efficiency is the only way to ensure we actually enjoy the destination rather than the journey.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Asuka,,"@Rin, a single invoice is only helpful if it's fair. I'm more concerned with the mechanism of payment. I'll maintain my focus on all-in rates and previous room costs to ensure we have a logical baseline.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Takumi,,"@Asuka, a ""logical baseline"" doesn't help if we're all crammed into one room or fighting over the shower. I'm not changing my mind. I need to know the actual layout and the rules.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Toshio,,"@Rin, it may seem boring, but the structure of our time often dictates the quality of the experience. I believe understanding our past patterns is the most practical way to ensure this trip is successful.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Rin,,"Okay! I've decided! I'm going to look into ""Pricing of offshore houses let whole"" and ""All-in rates against meals bought separately."" I want to find a place where the price is just one big, clear number!","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Shunichi,,"Fine. I'll handle the logistics. I'm choosing ""Ferry sailings and train time"" and ""Getting around by train and bus."" Let's hope the rest of you can manage the budget and bathrooms without a crisis.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Asuka,,"I will look into ""All-in rates against meals bought separately"" and ""What separately booked rooms cost last time."" I want to ensure we choose a payment structure that is transparent and prevents any individual from being overcharged.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Takumi,,"I'm not budging. I'm choosing ""Bathing hours and bathroom provision"" and ""Inn mealtimes and room arrangements."" If we don't have a proper setup, the whole trip is a waste of time.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Toshio,,"I will look into ""Time alone in the shared-house year"" and ""How last year's days ran."" I want to ensure we find a balance that allows us to be together without feeling overwhelmed.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
