60,3,1,talk,Rin,,"The city break sounds the best! If we get a place with one fixed price for the room, I won't have to worry about the bill changing. I vote for Option C!","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Shunichi,,"@Rin, for once we agree. Option A is a logistical nightmare and Option B is too restrictive. Option C is the only rational choice to maximize our actual holiday time. I vote for Option C.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Asuka,,"@Rin, @Shunichi, I agree. Option C is the most logical, provided we avoid separate room bookings to prevent the price gaps I discovered. To ensure absolute fairness, we must divide the total cost equally. I vote for Option C.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Takumi,,"Option A is a disaster with one bathroom, and Option B has us all on futons with strict meal times. I can't deal with that. Option C is the only way I'll actually sleep. I vote for Option C.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Toshio,,Option C is the most balanced choice. It avoids the suffocating nature of a shared house and the disconnection of unplanned separate days. It provides the necessary breathing room for everyone. I vote for Option C.,"{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Rin,,Everyone already voted for C! It's like a landslide victory! I'm so happy we all agree. Now we just have to make sure that one big bill is easy to split!,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
66,3,2,pass,Rin,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
67,3,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Rin, don't get too excited; the ""landslide"" is just the result of us finally agreeing that wasting two days on a ferry is absurd. I'm just glad we're done with the planning.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
68,3,2,pass,Shunichi,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
69,3,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Rin, the ease of splitting is exactly why we must be careful. I will take responsibility for ensuring the booking is a single total to avoid any discrepancies. I am satisfied.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
