71,3,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Asuka, just make sure that ""single total"" doesn't mean we're all in one room. As long as I have a door and my own space, I'm good. I'm done here.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
