73,3,2,talk,Toshio,,"Since we have a unanimous agreement, there is no need for further debate. Option C ensures we maintain our bond without sacrificing our individual peace. I am satisfied with this outcome.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
